      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحْمٌ كَبِيثٌ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكْبُوثٌ</span></b> , <i>Flesh-meat that has
been covered,</i> (K,) [and] <i>become</i> [<i>in consequence</i>]
<i>altered and stinking.</i> (TK.) AA explains
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَبِيثٌ</span> by the words <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحْمٌ قَدْ غُمَّ</span>. (TA.)

